@@ -25,6 +25,11 @@ Release date: TBA
 
   Closes #5019
 
+* Fixed a performance issue in the similarity checker (``duplicate-code``) that could
+  make ``pylint`` appear to hang, particularly when run with ``--jobs`` on projects
+  containing many similar lines. The per-lineset hashes are now computed only once
+  instead of once for every pair of files.
+
 * Fix regression for ``unspecified-encoding`` with ``pathlib.Path.read_text()``
 
   Closes #5029
